# Assigning by toughness is about combat damage only (CR 510.1a and the card's ruling). Streetwise Negotiator backs itself up
# (1/3) and blocks Grizzly Bears: it assigns 3 (the Bears die, as its power 1 would not kill them) and is dealt 2. Then it
# fights Ornithopter (CR 701.14a) and deals its power, 1, not its toughness: the 0/2 lives with 1 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Streetwise Negotiator
Bushwhack
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Streetwise Negotiator.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Attack(Grizzly Bears > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Streetwise Negotiator > Grizzly Bears)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Streetwise Negotiator.Damage = 2
? Bot2.Graveyard = Grizzly Bears
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bushwhack.Cast
Bot1.Modes(2)
Bot1.Target(Streetwise Negotiator)
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 1

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Streetwise Negotiator.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Streetwise Negotiator.Toughness = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Streetwise Negotiator.Damage = 0
